</header>

<main>

  <!-- ===== HERO ===== -->
  <section class="section va-hero">
    <div class="wrap va-hero-grid">
      <div class="va-hero-copy">
        <div class="va-eyebrow">Botaki Ba Pono — Visual Arts</div>
        <h1 class="va-title">Line, colour,<br>and <em>witness</em>.</h1>
        <p>Botaki Ba Pono is the visual art aspect of Botaki Ba Afrika, a dynamic department dedicated to nurturing artistic talent, deepening technical skill, and cultivating a sustainable creative economy for visual artists. Rooted in both craftsmanship and professional growth, this department exists to develop emerging artists who are equipped to thrive within any ecosystem.</p>
        <div class="va-stat-row">
          <div class="va-stat"><div class="num">18</div><div class="label">Artists</div></div>
          <div class="va-stat"><div class="num">120+</div><div class="label">Works exhibited</div></div>
          <div class="va-stat"><div class="num">6</div><div class="label">Group shows / yr</div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
